{"id": "70160", "title": "城府", "author": "绕梁三日", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 20, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70160.htm", "intro": "她是个窝囊的女人，潦倒半生，在她的记忆里没有过一个欢乐的片段。\n    他是一个强悍优雅的男人，却浑身沾满血腥，多年都在寻求灵魂救赎。\n    上帝的手指轻拨间，两个的命运开始纠缠。\n    男人带着强悍的手段把她捆绑到身边，搀扶着她，帮她挺直被生活压弯的脊梁，给她尊严，给她爱情，给了她一个全新的世界。\n    她来到他身边从开始被捆绑着，被动前行，到后来小心翼翼的跟随，直到最后终于握紧他的手，与他并肩前行，他们携手走过半生，到最后已经说不清是谁救赎了谁。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70160", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "10863873.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "10863874.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "10863875.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "10863876.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "10863877.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "10863878.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "10863879.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "10863880.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "10863881.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "10863882.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "10863883.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "10863884.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "10863885.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "10863886.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15-19", "file": "10863887.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20-25", "file": "10865169.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10865170.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10865171.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10865172.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45完结", "file": "10865173.html", "available": false}]}